{"type":"json_object","message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005, so the change is 2006 reserve minus 2005 reserve. I’ll calculate that in millions.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"warranty_2006 - warranty_2005","variables":{"warranty_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"million"},"warranty_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"million"}}}}